{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "train-libre F-Droid Repo"}, "description": {"en-US": "Automated F-Droid repository for train-libre"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/icon.png", "sha256": "11dc111a8d78af5f8b1b1b357ce9a14cdd6d1dc2b0164fc5330b515194573c7f", "size": 726}}, "address": "https://trainlibre.com/fdroid/repo", "timestamp": 1792459685000, "categories": {"Sports & Health": {"name": {"en-US": "Sports & Health"}}}}, "packages": {"com.rfivesix.trainlibre": {"metadata": {"added": 1792459664000, "categories": ["Sports & Health"], "issueTracker": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre/issues", "lastUpdated": 1792459665000, "license": "GPL-3.0-or-later", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre", "webSite": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre", "screenshots": {"phone": {"de-DE": [{"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/01.png", "sha256": "fff82a8542551f868332e20a124ed55bf1ba0ffc80ee794586d1539c6d00a8ee", "size": 626367}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/02.png", "sha256": "bd4d2d03ec41da7a7ce7b6201532cfa897ec90adda228e5f51bf091dae8c028e", "size": 1588502}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/03.png", "sha256": "b147380a8b7fd2084c6e4e04394774f6d087285d507a92ecbdb5f6c7ed525a76", "size": 392024}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/04.png", "sha256": "e0ef973cbad1d8ec489537ac9b313abd2562a08e45e122f88abd9af0ed338f77", "size": 607684}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/05.png", "sha256": "c1540642f23a735362aa302c3a83819dd2cf0d478158adda70279bfe2ce5bed8", "size": 608771}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/06.png", "sha256": "8b341f096f09cc0a68d338da33ecae2a646d57b19ca787a6e3fb5dc4627bed71", "size": 597673}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/07.png", "sha256": "53f5154f1aa3e1aea7fe98b97db5b9781cb829028d2ab03cd38e11d2c711fe01", "size": 616946}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/08.png", "sha256": "c00e7dc4d4f1a04b432f422a92c4e337a464122477f9f5fe8ac7350864356d10", "size": 467764}], "en-US": [{"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/01.png", "sha256": "61aacee987bdf65eeb70c2389bc640c714cbc9c6619ebd8dd002ae90fa6caf74", "size": 613824}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/02.png", "sha256": "8d1adf4049b1cd4186938931fcb43092c17bc08991b9a7050d69b0b5cc48a420", "size": 1597117}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/03.png", "sha256": "427bdc87e7eeb61e093b57157a11301daee52036eb4b4b3d078b56224c303262", "size": 382901}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/04.png", "sha256": "c29dead8255931d9efcdeb9e655b193aa070b46098a3cea64007522554c33180", "size": 599771}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/05.png", "sha256": "338693c0bb8ec193ffbaec11593d06eb426959b593b8e1e19f797bcd24cfd0b3", "size": 605975}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/06.png", "sha256": "dcce0e086c88b3b62ed34d34aae51bf2d7b74584bf03153a1d67827fc9efe650", "size": 606061}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/07.png", "sha256": "924d6f4a7dd6196cfe348de848a683ca19a455e701fa27509ba2a39350c9916b", "size": 626493}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/08.png", "sha256": "6011d2f8eb7c6ee3a32ae8c0e2b8fde03f3dd746ab8a154db1ab8c483c60a39a", "size": 444192}]}}, "name": {"de-DE": "Train Libre", "en-US": "Train Libre"}, "summary": {"de-DE": "Open-Source Tracker für Training und Ernährung mit lokalen Daten.", "en-US": "Open-source workout and nutrition tracker with local-first data."}, "description": {"de-DE": "Train Libre ist ein Open-Source Fitness-Tracker für Menschen, die Training und Ernährung ernsthaft protokollieren wollen, ohne die Kontrolle über ihre Daten abzugeben.\n\nFunktionen:\n- Workouts Satz für Satz protokollieren, inklusive Aufwärmsätzen, Arbeitssätzen, Sätzen bis zum Versagen, Dropsets, Wiederholungen, Gewicht und RIR\n- Routinen erstellen, wiederverwenden und abgeschlossene Einheiten auswerten\n- Ernährung, Mahlzeiten, Hydration, Koffein, Kreatin, Supplements, Körpergewicht und Körpermaße tracken\n- Statistiken für PRs, Konsistenz, Muskelvolumen, Recovery, Körpertrends, Kalorien, Schlaf, Schritte und Puls nutzen, sofern Daten verfügbar sind\n- App-Daten standardmäßig lokal behalten, inklusive Export und Import lokaler Backups\n- Integrierte Datenquellen auf Basis von Open Food Facts und wger verwenden\n- Unterstützte selbst erfasste Daten einseitig zu Google Health Connect exportieren\n- Optionale KI-Mahlzeitenfunktionen mit eigenem API-Key nutzen, standardmäßig deaktiviert\n\nWas Train Libre besonders macht:\n- Open Source und öffentlich entwickelt\n- Offline-first, ohne verpflichtenden Cloud-Account\n- Gebaut für strukturiertes Krafttraining statt Gamification\n- Transparente Analysen, die langfristig verständlich und nützlich bleiben sollen\n\nTrain Libre ist keine medizinische App. Recovery-, Schlaf- und Pulsfunktionen dienen der Trainingsplanung und persönlichen Orientierung und stellen keine medizinische Diagnose oder Behandlung dar.\n\nOpen Source:\nDer Quellcode ist öffentlich verfügbar und die App wird offen entwickelt.\n", "en-US": "Train Libre is an open-source, offline-first fitness tracker for people who want serious training and nutrition logging without giving up control of their data.\n\nFeatures:\n- Log workouts set by set, including warm-ups, working sets, failure sets, dropsets, reps, weight, and RIR\n- Build reusable routines and review completed sessions\n- Track nutrition, meals, hydration, caffeine, creatine, supplements, bodyweight, and body measurements\n- Use progress statistics for PRs, consistency, muscle volume, recovery, body trends, calories, sleep, steps, and pulse where available\n- Keep app data local by default, with export and import for local backups\n- Use integrated Open Food Facts and wger-based catalog sources\n- Export supported app-recorded data one way to Google Health Connect\n- Use optional AI meal features with your own API key, disabled by default\n\nWhat makes Train Libre different:\n- Open source and developed in public\n- Offline-first, with no mandatory cloud account\n- Built for structured gym tracking instead of gamification\n- Transparent analytics designed to be understandable and useful over the long term\n\nTrain Libre is not a medical app. Recovery, sleep, and pulse features are intended for training guidance and personal tracking only and are not medical diagnosis or treatment.\n\nOpen Source:\nThe source code is publicly available and the app is developed in the open.\n"}, "icon": {"de-DE": {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/icon_BDpnPPO5DCAteR-f5uh6yr8SZKF_miQjdDozt7si38I=.png", "sha256": "043a673cf3b90c202d791f9fe6e87acabf1264a17f9a2423743a33b7bb22dfc2", "size": 13030}, "en-US": {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/icon_BDpnPPO5DCAteR-f5uh6yr8SZKF_miQjdDozt7si38I=.png", "sha256": "043a673cf3b90c202d791f9fe6e87acabf1264a17f9a2423743a33b7bb22dfc2", "size": 13030}}, "preferredSigner": "7bea1cc437d23ad86535001c2996c22def49d8d75bd6b4942b6aad59572b17cc"}, "versions": {"80ac2f7416987f0dc441cdaa5af611752a09fab547836c214bb9146e238c16e0": {"added": 1792459665000, "file": {"name": "/app-x86_64-release.apk", "sha256": "80ac2f7416987f0dc441cdaa5af611752a09fab547836c214bb9146e238c16e0", "size": 43385564}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["x86_64"], "versionName": "1.6.0", "versionCode": 1010016, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 36}, "signer": {"sha256": ["7bea1cc437d23ad86535001c2996c22def49d8d75bd6b4942b6aad59572b17cc"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.RECORD_AUDIO"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 32}, {"name": "android.permission.WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 28}, {"name": "android.permission.CAMERA"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"